flex
flex is the fast lexical analyzer generator

github: https://github.com/westes/flex
license: modified BSD
license url: https://github.com/westes/flex/blob/master/COPYING

The selected upstream commit is defined in `projects/versions.mk`.

Building
flex is packaged with autoconf and requires autoreconf.

`ngettext_no_nls.patch` includes the bundled gettext compatibility header even
when translations are disabled. The selected upstream commit uses `ngettext`
in scanner diagnostics, so Android and bootstrap builds need its fallback.
The patch participates in the source signature.
